        "TileImage": "$($repository 6bb2d3f9-f1ad-4239-8bc8-5d100f3ec644).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\r\rThis may sound dark but, your target is William Candler, a kidnapped man by Ezra Berg.\r\rHe commited murders back in Paris, Sapienza, and multiple more around the world.\r\rTo get in... well, everything is hostile. Tricky, I should say. To kill him, I would recommend a remote explosive, even though the glass is unbreakable.\r\rEzra Berg kidnapped the man for you. But he doesn&apos;t know you&apos;re coming.\r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
